{
    "title": "True Talk - Global Wifi Calls",
    "description": "We have completely FREE calls and global voice call in True Talk.\r\n\r\nIn <b>True Talk</b> , you don't have to need a sim card or a number , all you need is a stable network.\r\n \r\n<b> 100% FREE CALL \u2028</b>\r\n100% Free & global phone call free. No contract, no hidden fees.\r\nNew users will get a bonus of 300 credits. Make your first True Talk now! By the way, you can get free credits from daily lucky spin and playing online games or view some ads.\r\n\r\n<b>8-way call</b>\r\nUpgrade your conference calling experience with True Talk's new 8-way conference calling feature. Connect with colleagues, friends, or family seamlessly with advanced audio technology and live video. Try it out today!\r\n\r\n<b> Call Recording \u2028</b>\r\nNow it supports the call recording function. You only need to tap the recording button during the call to record the call, which is more convenient and faster to save important information during the call.\r\n\r\n<b> Hide true caller id</b>\r\nYour true caller id can be hide now! We support to choose show the real caller id or not, if you want to protect your privacy, you can choose hide the true caller id! \r\n\r\n <b>International calls</b>\r\nTrue Talk allows you to make free international calls to anyone in the world, even if your friends do not have an Internet connection. We makes it available to make phone calls from any device with a network , which helps you make calls when traveling abroad. \r\n\r\n<b> No Phone Number Needed  </b>\r\nYou can make stable calls without a mobile phone number or a SIM card , we support both WIFI and cellular data networks.\r\n- In True Talk , all you need is a stable network.\r\n\r\n<b> Clear & Stable Calling \u2028</b>\r\nServer worldwide to ensure high quality phone calls with clarity and stability!\r\n\r\n \r\n\u2b50True Talk is a 100% FREE calling app with zero cost! You can get credits quickly to make voice calls by finishing tasks in the APP. Use this free phone calling app to call people; just call your loved one anywhere they are.\r\n \r\n\u2b50There are serval ways to earn free credits in our app. There is daily check-in, inviting new friends, watching videos, playing wheel games, etc. Just do exciting tasks, earn credits, and make call free! \r\n  \r\n\u2b50You have many choices to earn credit, and the simplest way just needs one tap on the screen. Earn more credits via completing some fun tasks. By the way, if you do not want to earn credit, you also can buy credit for calls.\r\n \r\n\u2b50True Talk uses real telephone lines, which means we can guarantee a good, crystal-clear voice call with high quality. True Talk automatically detects and adjusts your connection speed to ensure more stable calls. \r\n \r\n\u2b50True Talk can reach any mobile or landline number in more than 230+ countries or regions! Use True Talk to make global calls possible. Meet me, meet friends, and meet people anywhere on this voice calling app.\r\n \r\nOur calling rates are cheaper than most international calling apps. You can see the final cost of each call in the cost history. Also, the balance never expires.\r\n \r\n\r\n---\r\n \r\nTrue Talk - Connecting you to your international friends and family anywhere. \r\nStart your first FREE calls or low-cost calls today. \r\nTry this free calling app and enjoy unlimited Wi-Fi calls now!\r\n \r\nDon't forget to rate us a 5-Star(\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50), if you like us.\u2028\r\nDon't forget to share it with your friends, if you would like to help us.\r\nIf you need help or offer suggestions: truecall@mmcallsapp.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "We have completely FREE calls and global voice call in True Talk.<br><br>In <b>True Talk</b> , you don&#39;t have to need a sim card or a number , all you need is a stable network.<br> <br><b> 100% FREE CALL \u2028</b><br>100% Free &amp; global phone call free. No contract, no hidden fees.<br>New users will get a bonus of 300 credits. Make your first True Talk now! By the way, you can get free credits from daily lucky spin and playing online games or view some ads.<br><br><b>8-way call</b><br>Upgrade your conference calling experience with True Talk&#39;s new 8-way conference calling feature. Connect with colleagues, friends, or family seamlessly with advanced audio technology and live video. Try it out today!<br><br><b> Call Recording \u2028</b><br>Now it supports the call recording function. You only need to tap the recording button during the call to record the call, which is more convenient and faster to save important information during the call.<br><br><b> Hide true caller id</b><br>Your true caller id can be hide now! We support to choose show the real caller id or not, if you want to protect your privacy, you can choose hide the true caller id! <br><br> <b>International calls</b><br>True Talk allows you to make free international calls to anyone in the world, even if your friends do not have an Internet connection. We makes it available to make phone calls from any device with a network , which helps you make calls when traveling abroad. <br><br><b> No Phone Number Needed  </b><br>You can make stable calls without a mobile phone number or a SIM card , we support both WIFI and cellular data networks.<br>- In True Talk , all you need is a stable network.<br><br><b> Clear &amp; Stable Calling \u2028</b><br>Server worldwide to ensure high quality phone calls with clarity and stability!<br><br> <br>\u2b50True Talk is a 100% FREE calling app with zero cost! You can get credits quickly to make voice calls by finishing tasks in the APP. Use this free phone calling app to call people; just call your loved one anywhere they are.<br> <br>\u2b50There are serval ways to earn free credits in our app. There is daily check-in, inviting new friends, watching videos, playing wheel games, etc. Just do exciting tasks, earn credits, and make call free! <br>  <br>\u2b50You have many choices to earn credit, and the simplest way just needs one tap on the screen. Earn more credits via completing some fun tasks. By the way, if you do not want to earn credit, you also can buy credit for calls.<br> <br>\u2b50True Talk uses real telephone lines, which means we can guarantee a good, crystal-clear voice call with high quality. True Talk automatically detects and adjusts your connection speed to ensure more stable calls. <br> <br>\u2b50True Talk can reach any mobile or landline number in more than 230+ countries or regions! Use True Talk to make global calls possible. Meet me, meet friends, and meet people anywhere on this voice calling app.<br> <br>Our calling rates are cheaper than most international calling apps. You can see the final cost of each call in the cost history. Also, the balance never expires.<br> <br><br>---<br> <br>True Talk - Connecting you to your international friends and family anywhere. <br>Start your first FREE calls or low-cost calls today. <br>Try this free calling app and enjoy unlimited Wi-Fi calls now!<br> <br>Don&#39;t forget to rate us a 5-Star(\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50), if you like us.\u2028<br>Don&#39;t forget to share it with your friends, if you would like to help us.<br>If you need help or offer suggestions: truecall@mmcallsapp.com",
